# Netlify publishes the whole repo. The site only needs the app: server
# code and SQL stay off it. They hold no secrets; this just keeps how the
# server works to ourselves. "404!" answers "not found" even though the
# file exists.
#
# Old addresses (Home Screen apps still holding a previous version) rewrite
# to the new folders so a stale tab doesn't break. "200" keeps the old
# address in the bar; the file comes from the new place.
# A new Edge Function folder needs no new line here: /supabase/* covers it.

/style.css                                      /css/style.css  200
/script.js                                      /js/script.js  200
/camera-verify.js                               /js/camera-verify.js  200
/celebrations.js                                /js/celebrations.js  200
/challenges.js                                  /js/challenges.js  200
/onboarding.js                                  /js/onboarding.js  200
/home-screen-guide.js                           /js/home-screen-guide.js  200
/setup-scenes.js                                /js/setup-scenes.js  200
/i18n.js                                        /i18n/i18n.js  200
/i18n-es.js                                     /i18n/i18n-es.js  200
/i18n-guide-es.js                               /i18n/i18n-guide-es.js  200
/i18n-landing-es.js                             /i18n/i18n-landing-es.js  200
/supabase/functions/_shared/game-rules.js       /shared/game-rules.js  200
/supabase/functions/_shared/exercise-counter.js /shared/exercise-counter.js  200

/supabase/*                                     /404.html  404!
/CLAUDE.md                                      /404.html  404!

# The front page. getforja.app/ shows landing.html; the app stays at
# /index.html (the Home Screen app opens that, see manifest.json). An invite
# link (/?i=<code>) belongs to the app, so a shared link previews the app's
# card. "200!" serves the other file without changing the address, even
# though index.html exists. landing.html also sends app users on (its first
# script).
/  i=:code  /index.html  200!
/           /landing.html  200!

# getforja.app/install: the Home Screen steps as a page to send (install.html).
/install    /install.html  200
